@startuml
title Resumefolio | External interface outcomes
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify interface, intended operation, actor and target;
:Apply the relevant reviewed contract and authority checks;
if (Required authority and input conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
 :Perform bounded operation under interface-specific rules;
 if (Outcome established?) then (yes)
  :Record actual success, rejection or partial result;
 else (unknown / pending)
  :Retain uncertainty and defined reconciliation path; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
 :Apply only effects supported by established results;
 :Handle retry / cancellation under operation-specific policy;
else (no)
 :Deny or report invalid request without protected disclosure; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
:Show truthful permitted outcome and next action;
stop
legend bottom
Conceptual requirements flow, not a mandatory implementation sequence.
Read, send, Git write and deployment have different repetition risks.
No universal retry policy or exactly-once guarantee is selected.
endlegend
@enduml
